Z||000004||Voytek||06-27-2001||06:44 PM||||No, there were NO CD player options for the Fiero.  I think 'factory' in this case means 'GM-Delco'.  I bought mine for $200 CDN (about $130 USD) and it's the top-'o'-the-line Bose.  Sounds really good, too.  You will also need an antenna adapter.  If you have a built-in sub, you'll also need to do some tinkering.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
