Z||000006||Oreif||06-27-2001||09:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierodude:<BR><B>ive got a pioneer do i need a harness? wow i never knew fieros had a factory cd player option must have been pricy back in the 80s!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You can buy an adapter harness from any stereo shop to go from an aftermarket stereo to the stock harness connector for just about any car.||||reg||1
